**Code Animation Style Prompts (341 styles)**

Copyright (c) 2026 wqb578 / 俯仰观照 (animation style compilation)
Source: 来自俯仰观照博主的动画画风整理 ("compiled by the 俯仰观照 blogger")

### 1. Definitions

"Work" means all content in this repository: the 341 style prompts, 193 still frames,
reference implementation code, the `风格挑选.html` picker page, the `示例/` examples,
and the accompanying documentation. "You" means any person or entity exercising rights
under this license. "Redistribute" means making the Work or a substantial part of it
available to others in any form. "Derivative Work" means anything created by modifying,
rewriting, translating, re-editing or extracting from the Work.

### 2. Grant (free of charge)

Subject to this license, you are granted a worldwide, non-exclusive, royalty-free right to:
use the Work for any non-commercial purpose; copy it; modify it; and redistribute it
**free of charge**. You may feed the prompts to AI models and own whatever rights you
may have in the generated output under applicable law.

### 3. Prohibition on commercialization

You may **not** commercialize the Work or any Derivative Work without the author's prior
written permission. This includes, without limitation: packaging it into paid courses,
bootcamps, paid communities or paid columns; bundling it into paid skills, paid prompt
packs, paid plugins, paid templates or paid asset libraries; including it in a paid
product or paid service (including SaaS, subscriptions or members-only content); using
it to sell consulting, done-for-you work or deliverables; uploading it to any platform,
repository or drive that requires payment for access; or charging for it in any other
direct or indirect way.

In one line: **free to use, free to share, never for sale.**

### 4. Conditions for redistribution and derivative works

You must (a) credit the source with the statement
**「来源：来自俯仰观照博主的动画画风整理」** (or an equivalent, non-weakened statement);
(b) include this license (or a stable link to it) with any copy you distribute;
(c) impose no additional restrictions and claim no ownership; (d) **share your Derivative
Work for free** under terms substantially equivalent to this license; (e) mark any
changes you made; and (f) not imply that the author endorses you or your product.

### 5. Third-party portions

The L, V and X series are derived from the MIT-licensed open source projects
Lemo-Opuscar (Copyright (c) 2026 LemoLab), mg-styles-15 (Copyright (c) 2026
Vincentwei1021) and code-video (Copyright (c) 2026 Bae-ChangHyun) respectively. Those
